#: ../../source/how-to/index.md:22
msgid ""
"Run `inspect` and a quantization `--dry-run` before writing large output "
"directories. Most avoidable failures are easier to diagnose before shards"
" are written."
msgstr ""
"在写入大型输出目录之前，先运行 `inspect` 和量化 `--dry-run`。"
"大多数可避免的故障在分片写入之前更容易诊断。"

#: ../../source/how-to/index.md:24
msgid ""
"If a task fails, switch to the [troubleshooting guide](troubleshoot.md) "
"rather than guessing at the next step."
msgstr ""
"如果任务失败，请转到[故障排除指南](troubleshoot.md)，"
"而不是猜测下一步操作。"
